  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lily, Leo, and May are at school. They play a game on the grass. It is a game with a robot. Leo is the robot. He has a funny face. \"Robot says: stand!\" says Leo. Lily and May stand. \"Robot says: point to your nose!\" Lily points to her nose. \"Robot says: clap your hands!\" Clap, clap, clap! The girls are happy.",
      "\"Robot says: look at your feet!\" May looks at her feet. Lily looks at her feet too. Then Leo says, \"Jump!\" May jumps. Lily does not jump. \"Robot did not say it!\" says Lily. \"Oh no!\" says May. Leo says, \"Do you want to play again?\"",
      "Now Lily is the robot. She has a long sentence. \"Robot says: look at your hair and your feet!\" Leo looks at his feet. Then he looks at his hair. \"I can't see my hair!\" says Leo. May and Lily smile at Leo. They clap for the robot. It is a silly game. They love it."
    ],
    "summary": "Leo is the robot in a game at school. Lily and May do what the robot says, and Leo makes a silly mistake.",
